I'm trying to ascend a weaponless vegan monk on Sporkhack.  I've
just located the VS.  My castle wand is still at (1:1) and I'm trying
to decide how to use it.

Here's what my kit looks like so far.  My AC is -40.  Armor consists
of gauntlets of dexterity, speed boots, robe, T-shirt, and elven
helmet and shield.  I'm carrying the Orb of Fate and PYEC in addition
to the Eyes of the Overworld.  I have two wands of death and three of
polymorph, which with the PYEC give me an ample number of uses of
both.  I have 200HP, a dozen !oFH and three "oLS.  I have rings of
conflict, levitation, slow digestion, free action, and polymorph
control, the last of which I can use to poly into an Aleax when I
need to do some quick crowd clearing.  Useful spels include identify
and repair armor, both of which I can cast at 68% fail with the
shield on or 0% with it off.

I've genocided arch-liches, mind flayers, master mind flayers, and
disenchanters.

So, things are looking pretty good, but I still have lots of YASD
potential.  I can't keep my "oLS on all the time because I have no
shield of reflection and therefore rely on an "oR.  Being a vegan,
I can't bite my lizard corpse if a cockatrice gets me, so instead
I rely on a potion of acid, but that's in my bag most of the time
so it doesn't get boiled; I need to remember to pull it out before
facing a cockatrice.  I also have nothing greased so ;s are another
possible YASD, but as long as I'm paying attention I have lots
of wands for dealing with them.

So, possible wishing plans:

1. Wish for a shield of reflection and a magic marker.  Write 1 ?oC,
1-2 ?oEA, and then 1-4 ?oG depending on how much ink I have.  Genocide
magical eyes, then Nazgul, then if I have any ?oG left, bamf over to
Sokoban and do some nurse dancing.  This is what I'm leaning toward,
since it means I can YASD three times and still ascend.

2. Wish for two magic markers, and do the above genocides plus lots
more nurse dancing.

3. Save the wand for an emergency so I can wish for a rubber chicken.
I don't think this is as good an idea, because I already have an
ample safety net from my !oFH and "oLS.

4. Crazy idea: either wish for or hunt down a SDSM and use it despite
the monk penalty.  I have no idea how this would work.  I'm XL17 with
GM martial arts and 23 DEX.  If I could actually hit anything this
way, I'd become a walking sherman tank with -54AC, or even -64 when
polymorphed.

Suggestions?

